00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:25.500
that are suitable for the
conditions of the trip timing,

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.170
and it's got a suggested
three-day itinerary.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:33.030
Sweet. So, we have an agent that
we can now go and integrate back

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:35.040
with the Wayfinder web
app so that we can get

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:39.270
